  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">멘델프로젝트!<br><br>21년에 시작하여 3년간 이어진 대장정이 끝났습니다^^<br></p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends1\" data-emoticon-name=\"020\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"true\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/020.gif\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/020.gif\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>첫 해에는 딱 한 알 타가수분 성공했었고.ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3546e0f70ef8dfcdf0fa969048c3518a11ed38f4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3546e0f70ef8dfcdf0fa969048c3518a11ed38f4\" data-origin-width=\"1013\" data-origin-height=\"690\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br>대신 재배 기술과 타가수분 방법을 익혔습니다.<br><br><br><br>2022년에는 타가수분이 잘 돼서 우열법칙을 확인했습니다. 이론은 사실이었습니다.ㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b3ab03d48faf0c54613b50f120f21397b1c70c7\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6b3ab03d48faf0c54613b50f120f21397b1c70c7\" data-origin-width=\"1004\" data-origin-height=\"1335\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br><br>올해는 2022년에 얻은 잡종1대를 심어 잡종2대까지 얻었습니다. <br><br>우성 형질이 열성형질보다 많게만 나와주어도 성공이라고 생각했는데 <br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e756b45f2d1b9d9d3ef23d6a2c45c09a1317b786\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e756b45f2d1b9d9d3ef23d6a2c45c09a1317b786\" data-origin-width=\"874\" data-origin-height=\"988\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8727ae60102b79045cfaaf9f1a4a9a0793ec675\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8727ae60102b79045cfaaf9f1a4a9a0793ec675\" data-origin-width=\"945\" data-origin-height=\"1432\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>과연.. 비율이 어떻게 나왔을까요?<br><br>꽃이 피는 기간이 2주 정도여서 수확도 2주 정도 걸렸습니다. 최종 종자는 1800여개였구요~<br></p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends2\" data-emoticon-name=\"026\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"false\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends2/large/026.png\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends2/large/026.png\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p><div class=\"imagegridblock\" data-ke-type=\"imageGrid\"><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3a0e2d2cde92fab09cc5b2aa0e27fbb47c3bfc6\" data-origin-width=\"2633\" data-origin-height=\"3304\" style=\"width:36.45%; margin-right: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d3a0e2d2cde92fab09cc5b2aa0e27fbb47c3bfc6\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45cdb646587390af9860ae9fcdf6afbedee8f811\" data-origin-width=\"3952\" data-origin-height=\"2844\" style=\"width:63.55%; \"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/45cdb646587390af9860ae9fcdf6afbedee8f811\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span></div><div class=\"image-container\"><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/62e606037192bd54b2e637a5e7ae712ba480e05b\" data-origin-width=\"1905\" data-origin-height=\"1342\" style=\"width:37.04%; margin-right: 10px;margin-top: 10px;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/62e606037192bd54b2e637a5e7ae712ba480e05b\" class=\"txc-image-grid\"></span><span data-url=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc032459d8e1c42f10c81385fe9f25e72dac5e82\" data-origin-width=\"